<template><main class="public-info"><h1>Privacy information</h1><p>We store account details, business details, invoices, clients and payment records to provide the invoicing service. Platform administrators can view registered accounts, daily login statistics and activity metadata for operating the service.</p><p>Activity records contain the action, account, business and time. Request contents, passwords and API keys are excluded. Activity metadata is kept for 90 days when the retention job is configured; account and invoice records remain until removed according to your business needs.</p><p>Email messages are processed by the configured email provider. Public business logos and platform images may be hosted by Cloudinary if enabled by the operator.</p><p>Advertising is disabled by default. If enabled, Google may process advertising data on the public information page after the configured consent manager grants advertising consent. Private invoice and customer pages do not include ad placements.</p><p>Contact support using the link below to ask about your data. Businesses can delete their workspace through business settings. This page is a service disclosure; the operator must review its privacy notice and provider arrangements before enabling advertising.</p><RouterLink to="/about">Back to the service</RouterLink></main></template>
